extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VGbhnJ_ejB8Q7kNvwHNUdzb&_nc_oc=AdoLR4LhNHfeTFFAovUukKzDo1v8El4WTq2LWC60iHjeBh8_rzhE30Q90NoFLeW633U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ4XIsa8-nOnsyOsVjOIs37ZaC1RE5nTrvI1zbfutBpNA&oe=6ABBD756"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=57dkEK3LchsQ7kNvwGEQTAX&_nc_oc=Ado9zsqQpBaiwxH4-j576FNE3C9Xwqe-LEEuhgp_d0_wx95IaQknbT3hjKNgYtMPkU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKYUbCX3KlKRmEscX5yd61IEQaMHZ-QjMfF5ANUzet_WA&oe=6ABBDEA2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=24P-EpH4UgwQ7kNvwFZzRLJ&_nc_oc=AdrFBUd0xmtVNGJpdNTsV63YNitxEnJTRJiOHJn0j7DkW2al_faSKDxZ6xo4rWABgnI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJmvIucNJyj88JHAS7JSdButl8NkiRZ9rA49kJBi9MJMA&oe=6ABBAE59"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":